      "en": "But your wives, and your little ones, and your livestock, (I know that you have much livestock), shall live in your cities which I have given you,",
      "ko": "너희에게 육축이 많은줄 내가 아노니 너희의 처자와 육축은 내가 너희에게 준 성읍에 머무르라",
      "source_text_hash": "56cb49eff1ac71d6ac50df3aad33cc4f6f45bfa60f4349cded620026007be4e7",
      "translation_text_hash": "12f82c66163299ba0cef6d47adb70c070dcaec2ded9c6cd1f63178b0268002fd",
